From 9b5eaebd354ce5dd4c1ec7d88ec00c8bd2a1a6e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 16:27:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: move theme injection to one httpd serve-time filter
 (mergeability)

De-inline the Reaper theme from stock pages so they revert to pristine and merge
cleanly against upstream ASUS->Merlin GPL drops.

- httpd/reaper_inject.c/.h: a fopencookie() streaming filter injects the reaper
  <link> + bounce script once before the first </head>, for text/html only, with
  a basename skip-list (dashboard/shell/login/captive). Gated by nvram
  reaper_inject (default on; =0 + restart_httpd = pristine stock UI, no reflash).
  </head> matcher is fragment-boundary safe; fail-open if fopencookie is NULL.
- httpd/httpd.c: route the do_ej output call through reaper_output().
- httpd/Makefile: add reaper_inject.o to OBJS.
- 165 stock .asp reverted to pristine; 3 sysdep/RT-BE96U/www symlinks restored.

Off-device unit test 10/10 (exact-once inject, byte-identical passthrough); full
make rt-be96u links reaper_inject.o into httpd.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
